2. Check changes

git status

3. Add changes

git add .

4. Commit
git commit -m "Update SP International website"

5. Push to GitHub
git push origin main

6. Verify GitHub is updated
git status

You should see:

Your branch is up to date with 'origin/main'.
nothing to commit, working tree clean
7. Check latest commit
git log --oneline -3

Then go to Render → s-p-international → Deploys and check that the newest commit is deploying.

Important: Git commands cannot fix the Render error:

lstat /opt/render/project/src/. : no such file or directory

That is a Render configuration/path issue.